      "side": 1,
      "message": "There are two boards (proto2 and tk-v001) under private-cr52, which has only two USB interface: one for U2F, and the other for USB_Console. It doesn\u0027t define CONFIG_STREAM_USB, because it has nothing to bridge to USB.\n\nTechnically, it doesn\u0027t change the way it transfers data through USB much, considering the code similarity between usb_console.c and usb-stream.c before its recent optimization (https://chromium.git.corp.google.com/chromiumos/platform/ec/+/4a48404aeea58bfe0c31d5fea554b5329a223131/chip/g/usb-stream.c#).",
